  "prompt": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a continuous aerial tracking shot over a narrow Norwegian fjord just after sunrise. A colossal alien organism floats through the clear air twenty meters above the water. Its long translucent body is covered with overlapping opalescent plates, wet and finely textured like living nacre. Six broad ribbon-shaped appendages extend from its sides and undulate independently in slow traveling waves. Two branching sensory filaments sweep back from a blunt asymmetrical head with three small amber eyes. Through gaps in its plates, delicate blood vessels and faintly luminous amber organs are visible beneath the skin. The creature gently contracts its body as it moves forward, trailing thin strands of condensation. A small red fishing boat crosses beneath it, establishing the creature's enormous scale. Dark sheer mountain walls frame its pale body; low mist hangs over the water, and warm sunlight shines through the edges of its membranes. The camera tracks alongside with small amplitude at slow speed, close enough to resolve droplets and tiny scars, while the boat and distant cliffs shift naturally in parallax. Large-format wildlife documentary photography, believable anatomy in motion, restrained natural color, fine film grain, one uninterrupted five-second shot.\n\noverall_soundscape: A low resonant call from the creature vibrates across the fjord, layered with the soft rustle of its huge membranes and a steady mountain wind. Far below, the fishing boat's engine pulses quietly over the sound of water.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A sustained low cello note slowly opens into a spacious string chord with a faint glass-harmonica tone, conveying wonder without overpowering the creature's call.",
